window.products.push({"id":408167,"name":"164 Feet (50m) Multi-Function Garden Plant Twist Tie with Cutter for Plant Growing (Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610liTXBADL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Wist ties are what Americans formerly used to close up trash bags. Nowadays they’re used for pretty much everything but closing up trash bags! When it comes to growing plant indoors, twist ties are a welcome guest in our home and they are one of the most efficient tools available for LST (low stress training) and other methods of plant training. We use twist ties in two varieties: Regular twist tie is great for training young plants and it’s equally great at training new growth on growing plants. Bigger stems, however, can break loose from twist ties in a matter of hours depending on how fast they grow. Twist ties can also damage stems that grow too big if they're twisted on. Make sure to not secure twist ties by twisting them; gently wrapping the twist tie is a better method because it will pop off before it ever starts \"choking\" stems. Don't twist these on because it can \"choke\" your plants! Gently wrap twist tie around stems like a hook, and attach the other side to your container. In addition, twist ties is also suitable for homework, it can be used as cable tie to organizer headphones line, USB cable, computer line and mobile phone charger cable, keep your cables neat and organized. Features: - Plastic coated twist ties, strong and flexible  - Convenient built-in cutter allows you to get the length you want - Use it to tie up plants, tall flowers, hang bird feeders, keep tools in place, photo hanging wire, and so many other things - Enclosing wire, outsourcing plastic film; standard metal casing, scissors replace function, the interception of simple, safe, do not harm plants. Specifications: Length: 164 feet (50 m) Main material: plastic and iron wire Weight: approx.80g/roll Color: green","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610liTXBADL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JDYYICZ","source_asin":"B07869NG5X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-408167","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07869NG5X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07869NG5X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":408168,"name":"Tezzorio (Set of 6) 30 oz Stainless Steel Malt Cup, Professional Blender Cup, Milkshake Cup, Cocktail Mixing Cup, Commercial Grade Malt Cups","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.82,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Xj35xOPSL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Prepare your perfect milkshake and this 30-Ounce Malt Cup is just the perfect size to get you going! With a sleek mirror finish, 30 oz capacity and vertical groove on each side, this exceptional malt cup is ideal for making milkshakes and malts with spindle mixers or milkshake machines. Crafted from durable high-quality stainless steel. Holds more than enough liquid for any shake, smoothie, or malt. Professional grade Malt Cups are a must for every bar, restaurant, fast-food joint, diners or home. Extremely popular among professional bartenders all over the world. On those hot summer days when you just don’t have time to wash your mixing cup between each shake, they will certainly come in handy. Don’t hesitate to Stock up today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Xj35xOPSL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tezzorio","source_asin":"B06Y4XH7C5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-408168","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y4XH7C5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y4XH7C5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
