window.products.push({"id":408380,"name":"Can Openers Hand Held, Stainless Steel Can Bottle Opener, Smooth Edge Manual Can Openers with Large Turn Knob, Jar Opener with 1 Vegetable Peeler, Bla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UJGVDJqTS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"If you want to buy a durable and labor-saving can opener, Our kitchen can opener will be your best choice! With this multifunctional opener, easily opening various cans and caps, saving time and effort, you do not need to buy any other opener. Durability & Safety The safety can opener is made of food-grade stainless steel, it will not rust and crack, ensuring its durability and long service life. The design of the large knob and non-slip handle can protect you from sharp edges during use. Easy Operation Stainless steel can opener can easily slide on the top of the can, smoothly cut and anti-jump, easy to use, even a child could use it. Easy Clean-up Hand can opener with stainless steel construction makes it easy to be cleaned. After finishing opening a can, simply wash it through water and wipe with a cloth, then dry immediately. How to use? 1. Please open the handles and position the edge of the can between the blade and the gear.  2. Squeeze the handle of the can opener tightly until you see the cutting wheel pierce the can and hear the sound of vacuum escaping.  3. Please twist the knob clockwise until it cuts around the entire lid.  4. Please loosen the handle and carefully remove the separated cover from the opened can.  5.After usage wash the opener with water.  6.Dry the opener thoroughly Warning: 1. Please keep the product out of reach of children.  2. Do not place this item at high temperature in order to prevent plastic deformation.  3. Do not use the product for purposes other than those specified.  4. Wash this item after usage and wipe it to prevent dust. PACKAGE CONTAINS: - Can Opener x 1  - Vegetable Peeler x 1 CUSTOMER SERVICE - If you have any questions or issues about our Can Opener Manual, please do not hesitate to let us know, we will respond within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UJGVDJqTS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N?A","source_asin":"B08V4YLRB7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-408380","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08V4YLRB7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08V4YLRB7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
