window.products.push({"id":408437,"name":"Spulpy Premium Battery Operated Foaming Automatic Soap Dispenser, 8.5oz/250ml Hands Free Sensor Soap Dispenser, Touchless Electric Foam Hand Soap Disp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yvK0askLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Spulpy is the elegant personal hygiene solution Just place your hand under the nozzle and a perfectly measured amount of foam soap will be dispensed. Specifications: – Made of premium ABS plastic – Capacity of dispenser is 250ml / 8.5oz – Requires 4 x AA Battery (not included) – It comes with 1 x Soap Dispenser + 1 x Spout/Funnel + 1 x User Manual - 1-year manufacturer's warranty - Dimensions: 3.5 x 4.5 x 7.7 inches Features of the automatic foam soap dispenser: * Create foam directly, more convenience and easy to wash hands.* Fully automatic touch-free operation with the patented motion sensor, to avoid the second cross-infection and transfer of bacteria.* Work with whichever your favorite scented liquid soap or hand foam soap from any grocery store. Dilute the liquid soap with water at the ratio of 1:4 to start.* This sensor hand washer is widely in bathroom, kitchen, office, school, hospital, hotel and restaurant. Benefits of using a foaming soap dispenser: ► Friendly to environment* It is a diluted form of liquid hand soap, less soap is used per hand washing session.* Foaming hand soap can be used to lather without wetting the hands and water need only be used to rinse the soap away, which can reduce water usage during hand washing.► Cost-effective* Foaming soap dispensers release less soap than regular liquid soap dispensers do, allowing users to achieve the same level of cleanliness with less soap.* Foaming soap dispensers need to be refilled less often, saving both time and money.► Perfect amount for proper hygiene* Foaming soap is dispensed in a ready-to-lather form. Less of it is needed to fully cover hands in lather. * Equipped with flexible silicone valve to prevent dripping and stop messy drips or frustrating soap traces","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yvK0askLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spulpy","source_asin":"B07H1ZWXFZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-408437","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H1ZWXFZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H1ZWXFZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
