window.products.push({"id":408519,"name":"TYOARO Wooden Bread Bow Knife, Cherry (16\") - Serrated Sourdough Cutter for Homemade Bagels, Baguettes and More - Right-Handed, Cuts Thin, Even Slices","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515SJBZnFVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stop Crushing Bread: Specially designed for ideal weight distribution, our bow bread knife effortlessly cuts through soft bread fresh from the oven. The sleek serrated blade won't drag or pull, so you can enjoy full, fluffy slices without the hassle. Thin, Even Slices: From sandwiches to French toast, our bread knife cuts straight slices up to 1 7/8\" thick. It's all thanks to the flat handle and unique bow design, which provide a full frame of reference for smooth, consistent cuts. Endless Versatility: Measuring 16 1/4\" long and 2 3/8\" wide with a 9” cutting length, our wooden bread slicer is perfect for any homemade loaf. But why stop there? It also cuts bagels, baguettes, challah, fruit, vegetables, cheese, cake and more. Comfortable Control: Offering an ergonomic, right-handed grip, our bread slicer knife allows you to work with complete confidence. The deep scalloped edge requires just a light sawing motion, while the reusable blade guard ensures storage safety. Professional Quality: Crafted with North American cherry wood, our bread cutter is as beautiful as it is durable. The stainless steel blade never needs to be sharpened, and it wipes clean with just a damp cloth (towel-dry, not dishwasher-safe).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515SJBZnFVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TYOARO","source_asin":"B09FW4PRLK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-408519","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FW4PRLK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FW4PRLK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":408520,"name":"Silicone Trivet/Hot Pads for Hot Dishes - Easy to Clean Pot Holder for Kitchen - Durable, Flexible, & Multi-Purpose Mat That Helps Protect Countertops","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iqX5yMuXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUPREMELY VERSATILE: Our silicone trivet for hot pots and pans is one of the ultimate kitchen accessories & multi-taskers! Use it as hot pads to protect your kitchen countertops from scalding dishware—or as potholders to grip hot pans safely. This silicone pad functions as a food coaster, jar opener, and pot rest/spoon mat! MADE OF HIGH-QUALITY SILICONE: These silicone trivets are ultra-flexible, food grade silicone, and won't stick, stain, crack or absorb odors. Pot mat for oven is safe to use and will not change the color or taste of the food it touches. Plus, it's heat resistant up to 442°F! Keeping your hands and kitchen countertop burn free. MANY EXCITING & FUN COLORS TO CHOOSE FROM: Whether you want to compliment and match it to your kitchen gadgets/decor or your personality, our multipurpose modern trivet comes in many fun, vivid shades of color. Each package includes 2 eye-catching silicone mat trivet. DISHWASHER SAFE: When it needs to be cleaned, simply hand-wash our hot pan holder or toss it in the dishwasher. Virtually everything washes off the nonstick surface with ease—even sticky foods and grease. Bonus, these pads to put under pots are so easy to store! 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED – At Love This Kitchen, we use only the best materials to create top of the line rubber trivet that is made to last. Established in USA since 2002, here is our promise: If you aren't 100% thrilled with your purchase, just contact Amazon within 30 days for a full refund. Plus, all our products have a 1 year Guarantee, so Order Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iqX5yMuXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Love This Kitchen","source_asin":"B0C2NPBTVR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-408520","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2NPBTVR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2NPBTVR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
