window.products.push({"id":408536,"name":"ShenMate Portable Steamer for Clothes, Handheld Fabric Garment Steamer Perfect for Travel and Home, Fast Heat-Up Mini Steam Iron with Automatic Shut-O","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41qMYLcxemL._AC_.jpg","description":"What would be the most annoying thing when you are having a business trip?  Jet lag? Accommodation? Transportation?  The answer is NO.  It’s how to get a DECENT & SMART dress and suits. Here I would like to present you a useful tool - ShenMate Travel Steamer!  It is definitely your best buddy when you are in a formal occasion in other cities. Our steamer is in small size and portable.  It won’t occupy large room.  You can store it in your suitcase or backpack.  Absolutely suitable for a short trip. Our steamer has a unique design and its functions are in good condition.  Our steamer handle is comfortable to carry.  It can iron your clothes in a short time.  You couldn’t find any wrinkles left on your garment. Wanna keep your clean look in front of your coworkers all the time?  Wanna keep your T-shirts, shirts, suits and coats as new as the status of your first sight?  Get a ShenMate travel steamer for yourself. Make everything come true. Voltage(V): 120-240V  Power(W): 350W  Water Capacity(L): 80ML  Cable Length(ft): 7.2ft  Boiler Material: Titanium Aluminum Alloy  Ironing Head Material: PC+ABS  Package Size(Inch): 15*8*20cm  Package Weight(LB): 600g","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41qMYLcxemL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ShenMate","source_asin":"B07DLTPPN1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-408536","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DLTPPN1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DLTPPN1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":408537,"name":"Worms Etc Brand Red Wigglers Composting Worms 2 Pounds Over 2000 Worms!","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91r3QXnICxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Red Wiggler Worms (Eisenia fetida) Composting Composting with red wiggler is rewarding and easy. You will need: Container Bedding Worms Food waste A simple plastic container is all you need. A common size is one foot wide and two foot wide. An inexpensive ten gallon tote container makes a great worm bin. Add to the container a layer of bedding four to six inches deep. Coco coir peat is one of the best beddings available, but shredded newspaper, old leaves, old potting soil, and peat moss all will work. Make sure the bedding is moist but not saturated with water. Place the worms on top of the bedding and they will go down by themselves. Food and other organic waste can be buried into the bedding where the worms will compost them. To learn more read my vermiculture blog or order a copy of my book Red Wiggler Worm Composting Guide. Red wigglers are small worms, but even so are loved by fisherman and fish alike. If a larger worm is desired the European Red Worm is excellent for bait and also compost well. Shipping Information ***PLEASE READ*** We currently are trying to ship worm orders within 24-48 hours. Weather and other random things can affect our shipping schedules though. Please email me if you must have the worms on a certain day and I will do my very best to get them to you. All worms are shipped via Priority Mail. If you need them shipped through another method please call me. My cell number is listed on the left side of the webpage. I appreciate your business very much. You will receive an email with the delivery date and tracking number when your order ships. Shipments are guaranteed to arrive alive, but must be collected and opened within an hour of delivery. See our full policy here. THANK YOU! At Worms Etc your business is very important to us, and we value you as our customer. Please contact us with any questions or concerns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91r3QXnICxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Worms Etc","source_asin":"B00F4DVNFY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-408537","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00F4DVNFY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00F4DVNFY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
