window.products.push({"id":408563,"name":"EVA Raincoat for Adults Reusable, Long Vinyl Rain Poncho for Women Men Rain Jacket with hood Plastic Trench Rain coats…","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NJKAGF3WL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"eva 进口 Drawstring closure Hand Wash Only Premium EVA Material: This EVA Raincoat with drawstring hood is made of real 100% eco-friendly EVA material, non-toxic, no smell, and tear-resist. Save the earth!!! The long rain jacket is super soft, and skin-friendly, the best part is not noisy when you wear this rain coat. All other competitors use cheap PE + EVA material which is noisy and harmful to the environment. Fashion Design: The thick material allows us to add two side pockets to the rain poncho, which is convenient for you to keep small belongings like keys, phones and cards. The loose design will give your more movement when you do outdoor activities, the large brim helps you to keep the rain from your face. Cute color see though rain gear will look flattering and catch the eye of the people. Packable and Durable: The full-body transparency plastic rain cape comes with a vinyl pouch, which is convenient for travel and storage, lightweight and thicker material make the raincoats more durable than any other EVA rain ponchos. Thick and Waterproof: The thickness of this raincoat is 0.18mm, which is almost 2 times thicker than any other rain ponchos on the market. Impermeable and 100% waterproof guarantee. Widely Application: This rain coat is loose design for unisex, man or women. Perfect For Outdoor Activities: You will never be unprepared for the sudden rain shower, our heavy duty rain ponchos are perfect for Disneyland world, concert, corporate events, amusement parks, camping, hiking, tailgating, fishing, travel, sports stadium or any great outdoor activity that you love.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NJKAGF3WL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Artrello","source_asin":"B0B2N9GMFT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-408563","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2N9GMFT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2N9GMFT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":408564,"name":"Black Stag Deluxe Silicone 2 mold set - Gingerbread Santa, Reindeer and Sleigh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s5K3n45oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easily create a festive themed 3D gingerbread structure featuring Santa, his team of reindeer complete with his sleigh and gifts! This 2 mold set is simple and effective at creating a structurally sound and adorable gingerbread display.Some of the benefits of silicone bakeware: Heats up quickly and bakes evenly with no burnt/ dark edges or bottom. They're freezer, refrigerator, microwave, dishwasher and oven safe Bake, store, freeze and reheat in the pans Suitable for temperatures from -4 to 446 Fahrenheit (-20 to +230 Centigrade). No need to alter your batter or temperature - bake as usual. Removal from pans is super easy - a slight twist or gently pulling on the sides and roll out your baking. No rusting or staining. Easy cleaning - simply pop your molds in the dishwasher or clean with warm soapy water. Lightweight and perfect for a camper or RV. Easy storage - although they do not easily nest, no special attention is required and they retain their shape. A multitude of uses - perfect for gingerbread but also great for other craft projects and festive baking and cookery Some ideas to get you started: chocolates hard candy fondant cookies frozen yogurt treats cake decorations candles ice cubes kids party activity or favorsTop tips for successful use: Pans are hot to touch while in the oven but cool down quickly; use hot pads to remove them Using a baking sheet underneath to provide stability, required as the mold is flexbile for easy removal Wash pans thoroughly before first use Do not use knives or sharp objects - they could damage your pans Never use on an open flame, or on stovetop burners Product contain 2 x red silicone molds, baked product is for reference only.ORDER NOW by clicking the Add to Cart button at the top of the page.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s5K3n45oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Black Stag","source_asin":"B01MCVDTOS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-408564","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MCVDTOS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MCVDTOS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
