window.products.push({"id":408655,"name":"AW - Bamboo Steamer Basket 10 Inch - Natural Bamboo Dumpling Steamer - Heavy Duty Cooking With Stainless Steel bands. Perfect as a Dim Sum Steamer Dum","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ac5EX8FgL._AC_SL1229_.jpg","description":"Express your Asian skills and impress your friends and Family HEATLHY CHOICE - Steaming foods allows to retain more of your foods' ingredients. The heat transfer is always at the same temperature which allows the food to cook fast, evenly and fewer micronutrients are lost. In addition, you don’t need any oil or fat to cook a delicious meal. LONG LASTING - Bamboo is an extremely strong natural material. However, due to high temperatures and its versatile use, it can promptly brake on the sides. For this reason, professional Asian restaurants prefer to have a reinforced food grade stainless steel ring. Ensuring the bamboo steamer longer longevity and use without sacrificing any of the real taste. BONUS - Two pairs of chopsticks for a full Asian experience, perfect for dumplings, ravioli, fruit pies and others. Made out of natural cotton these two liners are designed for excellent steam circulation. Line the bottom of your bamboo so that your foods don’t stick plus simplify your basket cleanup. HOW TO USE : Use a regular steamer pot or steamer pan half-full with water to provide the steam. Once the steam has started place the bamboo steamer on top of the pan or pot. Once you have inserted your food into the basket place the lid on top of the steam basket. IMPORTANT - HOW TO CLEAN : To take care of the steamer, wash carefully ( use 3 tablespoon of vinegar / 1 liter of water) and leave it in open space until it dry completely. Our product does not contain chemicals to preserve the natural bamboo material and is not dishwasher safe. Each vegetable steamer basket can be used separately. Each bamboo steamer basket can be used as hot dog steamer, dim sum steamer, bun steamer, tamale steamer or simply as a steam basket for vegetables. . Keep the real Asian taste","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ac5EX8FgL._AC_SL1229_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Always Weekend","source_asin":"B07PZL4D37","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-408655","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PZL4D37","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PZL4D37","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
