window.products.push({"id":408693,"name":"Velvet Stretch 8-Pieces Recliner Sofa Covers Reclining Couch Covers for Home Theater Recliner (Chocolate)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-QXUjzBEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Cozy and Soft Velvet Furniture Slipcover can not only protects your recliner from daily wears and tears, stains, kids, scratches from pet claws or accidental spills, but it can also transform an old, worn out couch into the new stunning centerpiece of your room. Our recliner slipcovers also help you update your décor, chamger colors and texture when you like and avoid you the costly investment of a new furniture. Why Choose Our Recliner Cover? Our recliner cover has a good wear resistance and fully protects your furniture, greatly prolong the service life of the recliner. If your recliner is partially broken, now use our slipcover to prevent the recliner from wear and tear. High Features for Our Velvet Recliner Cover: ·Ultra thick and soft velvet fabric makes our sofa covers more stretchy and durable, rich and comfortable ·Compared to one piece, 8-PIECE design will perfect fit your furniture better, definitely like customized, makes your furniture a brand new look ·Easy to put on and off, the elastic loops will keep your slipcover from slipping and wrap your recliner better ·A must-have for homes with children and pets. Having a recliner cover will protect your furniture from daily wear and tear ·With a brief style and appealing colors, these slipcovers are suitable for various styles of furniture and decoration, make your old furniture appear brand new How to Install 1.Find the CENTER BACK OF COVER label. Stand behind the recliner and drape it over the upper back of the recliner. Attach elastic straps to the hooks located at the bottom of recliner. 2.Using the cover with label LEFT ARM cover the corresponding arm of the recliner. 3.Using the cover with label RIGHT ARM cover the corresponding arm of the recliner. 4.Find the CENTER FRONT OF COVER label. Drape it on the footrest. Tying the elastic straps together under the footrest.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-QXUjzBEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NC HOME","source_asin":"B08NG38RMW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-408693","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NG38RMW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NG38RMW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
