window.products.push({"id":408712,"name":"Snif Sweet Ash Scented Candle, 8.5oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KD+I93sQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our most popular fine fragrance is now a smooth-burning, delicious candle. This low-key sweet and earthy scent goes from inviting to addictive fast. With a comfy blend of moss, woods, fir balsam, tonka, and vanilla bean, you’ll want to light it up in every room in your home. 50+ HOURS BURN TIME: Our 8.5 oz candles are designed to burn for 50+ hours when properly cared for. The combination of our high-quality raw materials, blend of soy and vegetable wax, and our pure cotton wicks ensure that our candles will perform for an extended period of time. NON-TOXIC, VEGAN FORMULAS: All of our candles are formulated with clean industry standards. That means they’re non-toxic, paraffin-free, vegan, and cruelty-free. We also use 100% pure cotton fiber wicks for a clean, safe burn. From the beautiful containers to the formulas, our scented candles are 100% made in the USA. If you have any questions or concerns about our formulas, please email us at hello@snif.co CANDLE CARE: On your first burn, allow the entire surface of wax to melt (2-3 hours). Limit each burn to a max of 4 hours and make sure your candle is lit in a safe place. Between burns, trim your candle wick to 1/4\" before lighting. This will help reduce smoke, maximize burn time, and reduce mushrooming. For your safety, keep your wax free of debris. Never leave your candle unattended and do not place the lid on your candle when lit. FINE FRAGRANCE-LEVEL SCENTS We use the same, premium quality fragrance in our scented candles that we do in our fine fragrance. For optimal burn and performance, we pair this with a high-end blend of soy and vegetable wax that enhances the concentration and throw of your candle’s scent.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KD+I93sQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Snif","source_asin":"B0BQSGRPVM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-408712","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQSGRPVM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQSGRPVM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
