window.products.push({"id":408809,"name":"HOMCA Pillow for Side Sleeper Body Pillow for Adults Memory Foam Pillow with U-Shaped Contoured Support for Neck, Back, and Shoulder Pain Relief with ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":62.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615fvaA4DtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【U-shaped design】- The unique U-shaped side pillow conforms to the ergonomic design. when siding sleeping, neck, buttocks, and body can be aligned correctly to achieve a neutral joint fixation. Effectively adjust and correct the side sleeping posture 【Arm contour design】-The arm contour design conforms to the side sleeping habits, the contour length:165mm, width: 100mm, The size meets the arm of most weight people. can quickly find a comfortable arm position to Relieve pressure on shoulders and arms, Avoid the problem of arm numbness due to the lack of blood circulation. 【Slope design】- HOMCA pillow for side sleeper for neck and shoulder pain adopts a slope buffer design, providing high enough support for side sleeping. When side sleeping, the height of the highest side is compressed to the right position, which can help relieve headaches, cervical strain, and shoulder pain, allowing you to left or right side sleep comfortably 【High-quality memory foam】- HOMCA pillow for side sleepers use high-density memory foam pillows, which can sense body temperature to match the softness to provide the most stable comfort.it has slow rebound characteristics, no deform under heavy pressure, and maintains comfort 【Ear hole pressure relief】-This contour pillow for side sleepers is equipped with a widened ear hole pressure relief design on both sides, the ear hole width:5.5CM, Increases the ear movement space, reduce ear friction and pressure, no toss and turn due to uncomfortable ears, and no fix your neck like other contour pillows 【Removable and washable pillowcases】- HOMCA pillow for side sleeper for shoulder pain adopts hypoallergenic rayon/polyester blend pillowcase， it is fine texture, feel soft, not wool, not the ball, easy to clean, machine washable, the breathable structure allows air to circulate and keeps you cool all night 【Upgraded Version】According to the experience and suggestions of many customers, we have changed the round ear holes of the side sleeping pillows to drop-shaped ear holes, so that you no longer have to worry about the height of the ear holes being too high to reach. At the same time, softer memory foam and a gentler slope allow for a more comfortable angle of support for your head. If you need an extra pillowcase that can be replaced when the pillowcase is washed, please search for ASIN: B0BWXQ4FF4 to purchase it yourself.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615fvaA4DtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMCA","source_asin":"B0B4NFW8ZP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-408809","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4NFW8ZP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4NFW8ZP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
