window.products.push({"id":408815,"name":"Bad Advice from Wine - Funny Notebook with Wine Quotes - You Should Post That Selfie on ALL Your Social Media!","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LV4caYX2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Do you know the difference between Cabernet, Sauvignon, and Merlot? Are your senses in exquisite shape from multiple wine tastings and classes? Whether you are a wine connoisseur, just love having a glass (or four) after a long day, this notebook is perfect for you. For all the times we’ve heard bad advice, no advice can compete with that from a bottle of wine. Even after a couple of glasses, we’re still treading in dangerous advice territory. We all need a little humor, and wine in our lives, let this notebook bring a little of both. Use this full-bodied notebook as a classy list-keeper, elegantly keep track of your to-do’s, or just use it to keep the kids occupied while you’re chatting (or sipping). The possibilities are endless. This notebook pairs well with any bottle of wine - making it the perfect give for that beloved wine-loving mother, girlfriend, sister, grandmother, in-law, or any other wine-o in your life. So grab a glass, pop the bottle and enjoy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LV4caYX2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"School Datebooks","source_asin":"B07S5G7KYN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-408815","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S5G7KYN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S5G7KYN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
