window.products.push({"id":408892,"name":"bzyoo 26oz HyPro Insulated Stainless Steel Double Wall Nutrition Shaker Water Bottle Protein Cup with Mixing Ball Wire Whisk Leak Proof Portable for G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Gjaf2L7hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SHAKER BOTTLE IN STYLE: More than just a normal go-to muscle booster cup, a subtle design reflects the simplicity and beauty of elegance that is different from other shaker bottle. The vivid color and refine style design of HyPro protein shaker bottles will definitely stand out either in the gym or on the go! DOUBLE WALLED INSULATION: 26oz HyPro bottle comes with 100% leak-proof twist-on spout lid along with a double wall vacuum insulated design will keep your cold drinks cold. Its condensation-free sturdy powder coated exterior prevents your bottle from sweating in your hands and gives you a firm surface to grip. MULTI-PURPOSE: For a shaker bottle that can keep up with your busy day, this is a great option to use for keep yourself hydrated all the time – iced coffee, nutrition shake, smoothie or drinking water and etc. The carrying loop also makes it more portable than most protein shakers for everyday use. MIXING BALL INCLUDED: HyPro shaker bottle comes with a stainless steel whisk mixer ball. Simply add your liquid and supplement powder in the bottle then shake with the mixing ball inside for a silky texture. The wire whisk ball is removable for easy cleaning. GOOD SIZE: HyPro bottle comes with 26 oz capacity, which is a good size to keep you hydrated throughout the day without having to refill it frequently. It is easy to carry with you. PREMIUM QUALITY: This leak proof water bottle and the mixer ball are made with superior quality, highly durable stainless steel and it's 100% BPA free and toxin free. IDEALS GIFT FOR EVERYONE: bzyoo HyPro shaker bottle comes with a well-designed white box that is easy for gifting. Spoil your loved ones or friends with this insulated protein shaker bottle. This stunning protein shaker will impress them with its durability and its versatility. CUP HOLDER FRIENDLY: Take your portable, leak-proof and spill-proof HyPro water bottle everywhere you go. It fits in most cup holder.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Gjaf2L7hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"bzyoo","source_asin":"B0B3WXM4TP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-408892","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3WXM4TP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3WXM4TP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
