window.products.push({"id":408931,"name":"Air Fryer Cooking Times Chart Magnetic Cheat Sheet Set Cookbook for Beginners, Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner, Air Fryer Accessories 125PCS Air Frye","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TmylHvVQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ AIR FRYER ACCESSORIES SET ]: Each pack comes with 125 pcs air fryer liners, 2 pcs cooking time cheat chart sheets and 20pcs fork. Parchment paper stands high temperatures up to 428℉(To prevent the Paper liner from burned, please do not heat the air fryer with no food on it!). [ QUICK REFERENCE GUIDE ]: The air fryer cooking times chart sheets feature a magnetic backing that allows you to easily stick them to your fridge or any other magnetic surface in your kitchen. Magnet Sheet show the Cooking Time, Temperature, and Size of food to take the guesswork out of cooking, so you don’t have to waste time looking things up. [ COMPLETE AIR FRYER RECIPES COOKBOOK ]: Our air fryer cooking cheat sheets feature 74 most common foods including Vegetables, Frozen Foods, Beef, Chicken, etc. that are properly classified and labeled to make sure you can read them at a glance. They make the perfect addition to any gift box and gift basket for all gifting occasions. [ MULTI-USE ]: Baking pads have 6.5 inches on bottom, 8 inches on top, 2 inches high, perfects for 3-5 quart air fryer, toaster oven, instant pot, microwave, pan. Perfect for meat, fish, French fries, chips, chicken wings and thighs, chicken tenders, rib eye steak, steak bites, sweet potatoes, tater tots, carrot fries, meatballs, butterfly shrimp, zucchini fries, vegetables, broccoli, fajitas, dessert, cinnamon apples, blooming onion, char siu, pizza rolls and sausage links. [ NON-STICK, WATER-OIL PROOF ]: The liner are made of food-grade natural wood pulp, has a food-grade silicone coating that makes it waterproof and oil-resistant, keep your air fryer clean. Using disposable air fryer paper liners, heating all the food quickly, solve the trouble of washing the basket before each cooking. [ IMPORTANT INFO ]: Thanks to customers for strong support to our promotion on April 22. During the promotion period, the price only includes 125pcs air fryer liners. After April 22nd, we upgraded the product, adding 2 pcs cooking time cheat sheets and 20pcs forks to the original 125pcs fryer paper. If you have any questions after receiving the product, please feel free to email us through Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TmylHvVQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EWONUE","source_asin":"B09QKV5B3H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-408931","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QKV5B3H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QKV5B3H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
