window.products.push({"id":408943,"name":"Monogram Bold Letter B - Stemless Wine Glass - Personalized Gifts for Women and Men - Large Engraved Glasses","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fJNxGuBML._SL1200_.jpg","description":"Unique custom Bold Letter B wine glass is a great gift for any celebration with friends and family.  High quality, large stemless wine glass made in the USA  Etched design (not printed) - The text is engraved by hand in Colorado and will never wear off  Individually gift boxed glasses designed to ensure safe delivery  Dishwasher safe! Great for daily use Hand etched monogrammed wine glasses with engraved initials make fantastic gifts for your best friend, mom, or anyone who loves wine. If you're wishing a big happy birthday to your friends, newlywed couple, mom, grandma, coworkers, or boss, the beautifully engraved unique bold letters on this glassware will leave your recipient fondly remembering the memories created with this fun gift for years.   Eye catching saying meticulously etched (not printed) into the cup so that it never wears off. These glasses are the perfect custom, classy wine accessories for your fabulous friends and family's birthdays, weddings, and celebrations.   Its generous size allows wine to breathe and fully develop the rich bouquet of flavors from wines you would expect from fine crystal. Yet, this wine glass makes a great gift under $20!   This isn’t a cheap novelty gag gift. This is quality, hand blown, dishwasher-safe glassware that is perfect for use as your daily wine glass.   All Bevvee glasses are individually boxed and protected for safe delivery, no matter how much they're tossed around during shipping. The carefully etched text will never wear off with heavy washing. Each letter was engraved by hand by skilled artisans in our small shop in Northern Colorado. Wine not get one now? Cheers!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fJNxGuBML._SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bevvee","source_asin":"B08VX3TMKQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-408943","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VX3TMKQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VX3TMKQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
